    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Meet Cute&quot;</strong> is a brand-new series of visual novels focused exclusively on brief love stories. There\u2019s no drama, no overwhelming amounts of text\u2014just you and a date with Alice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you stroll through the city streets, your mind is preoccupied with thoughts of work, and the upcoming meeting is all you can think about. Unfortunately, you stumble into a puddle, soaking your entire outfit in dirt. What can you do now? Enter a random caf\u00e9 and ask to wash your clothes, of course! That\u2019s how your very own &quot;Meet Cute&quot; occurs, and that\u2019s where it all begins...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A charming meet-cute story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">HD, fully original artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Approximately 1 hour of content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hot waitress!</p></li></ul>",
